WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.420
Where I come from

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:08.450
a lot of women have fake hair.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.769
I often wear wigs or have extensions

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:12.690
plaited into my natural hair.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.379
And sometimes the hairstyle can take up to two days.

00:00:15.379 --> 00:00:17.310
It’s a lot of time that needs to be filled,

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.590
So people at the salon talk about their life.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.480
But it’s not just the women who are here

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.759
to have their hair done.

00:00:23.759 --> 00:00:25.589
You often have people coming in and out

00:00:25.589 --> 00:00:27.210
just to have a chat.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.630
It’s because you have here a level of trust

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.070
that you hardly find anywhere else.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.950
And this trust leads to better stories.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.010
I became a journalist because I wanted to
be a storyteller.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.150
And I want to find those real authentic stories

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:41.760
about everyday people

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.120
who have something to share.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.420
Now, with all the time I’ve spent at the
salon,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.830
I know high quality hair when I see it

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:50.190
and a good story when I hear it.

